From 017286f06c92b1a4c6cd4b10dd42d85bbee84490 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Coolmanchambers <coolmanchambers@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 19:30:04 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] feat: dedicated Vital Pet Pro map, camelCase modes, fresh
 traceId/token per request

- Add LAP-P501S-WUSR/AUSR as their own PurifierMap (fan 1-3, sleep/manual/
  odorShield modes) instead of the Vital 200S entry; drop fan_max_level.
- Add odorShield modes to PurifierModes; match set_mode case-insensitively
  so camelCase device modes are accepted, sending the map's spelling.
- Parse VOC, odorLevel, filterRemainDay, buzzerSwitch (optional fields).
- get_defaultvalues_attributes returns a fresh dict with a new traceId per
  call; get_manager_attributes is no longer cached, so request bodies pick
  up a new token after re-login.
- Tests: real Pet Pro status fixture, signature vs official app captures
  (#477), token/traceId freshness regression tests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
